+# Billing disputes
+
+Billing questions are categorized by `classifyBillingQuestion`. A message containing the exact lowercase text `refund` is classified as `refund-review`; every other message is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+This categorization does not establish refund eligibility, invoice correctness, or authorization to perform a billing action.

